OL,3,GNEWSAKaren Henthorn 'thrilled' with
OL,4,ADinnerladies stage tour
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer EastEnders and Coronation Street
OL,7,Factress Karen Henthorn has said she is
OL,8,F"thrilled and shocked" to be starring
OL,9,Fin a UK stage tour of Dinnerladies.
OL,11,FHenthorn will play Dolly Bellfield in
OL,12,Fthe theatre adaptation of the classic
OL,13,FBBC sitcom, alongside stars including
OL,14,FSue Cleaver and Les Dennis.
OL,16,FThe show is the first to be
OL,17,Fcommissioned by the Victoria Wood
OL,18,FEstate since the comedian's death in
OL,19,F2016, aged 62.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
